# Go Standards

- Follow standard Go project layout
- Handle all errors explicitly; never ignore returned errors
{{#if parameters.useContext}}
- Pass `context.Context` as first parameter to I/O functions
{{/if}}
- Use `gofmt` and `golangci-lint` before committing
{{#if parameters.tableDrivenTests}}
- Write table-driven tests with `t.Run` subtests
{{/if}}
- Prefer composition over inheritance
